---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import TwoMaps from '../components/TwoMaps.astro';
import { heroes, WP } from '../data/images';
// Real screenshots of the live platform (captured from the app itself —
// regenerate via the capture script whenever the product evolves).
const img = {
  what: '/screens/home-feed.png',
  why: '/screens/assistant-chat.png',
  begin: '/screens/membership.png',
};
---
<BaseLayout overHero={true} title="About — Lichen" description="An overview of the science and spirituality that inform our approach to holistic healthcare.">
  <section class="phero">
    <div class="phero-bg"><img src={heroes.about} alt="" style="object-position: 50% 20%;" /></div>
    <div class="container phero-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow proj-eyebrow">Human Evolution</span>
      <h1>Human healing is the solution</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fsection intro-section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="intro-lead">As Crazy Horse foresaw 150 years ago: a movement is forming to help humanity heal and grow into worthy stewards of the planet. Lichen is here to provide the technology platform and business infrastructure necessary to weave together the plants, animals, elements and people of this movement, so they can radically collaborate in pursuit of a brighter future.</p>
      <a href="https://vimeo.com/1031804180" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-up">▶ Watch the Video</a>
      <p class="intro-note">The social, political and economic systems that divided, disempowered and disconnected us are crumbling. We have the opportunity to build better ones.</p>
      <hr class="intro-rule" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fsection sec-block">
    <div class="container sec-grid">
      <div class="sec-pic"><img class="phone-shot" src={img.what} alt="" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div class="sec-copy">
        <h2 class="display sec-title">What is Lichen?</h2>
        <p>Inspired by the forest using the mycelium to share information, carbon, water and medicines, Lichen is a technology <a href="/project/platform">platform</a> that empowers the safe and effective sharing of information and resources to foment individual, social and ecological healing. Like the trees, Lichen's members collaborate, because we know that the health of the collective and the individual are one and the same. Because the sole focus of our <a href="/project/business">business</a> is to expand access to the care our members need, the bigger we grow, the greater our capacity to restore health and balance. Value moves through the network via a <a href="/conscious-economy">conscious economy</a> — a Universal Current-cy pegged to the global economy, so every contribution can be tracked, honored, and translated into the wider world.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fsection sec-block">
    <div class="container sec-grid flip">
      <div class="sec-pic"><img class="phone-shot" src={img.why} alt="" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div class="sec-copy">
        <h2 class="display sec-title">Why build Lichen?</h2>
        <p>Physics can now measure what eco-spiritual peoples have known for millennia: there is a quantum field of consciousness that connects everything in the universe. The biological sciences are now advanced enough to measure how and why tapping into that field can help us heal at the cellular level. Once engaged with that field, we remember our interconnection with all things, inspiring us to transform Crazy Horse's vision into a reality.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The economy's argument, in one visual — ported from the app's About
       page, which remains the canonical deep version. -->
  <section class="fsection sec-block">
    <div class="container maps-wrap">
      <div class="maps-copy">
        <h2 class="display sec-title">Designed for reciprocity. Tuned for reconnection.</h2>
        <p>Every system is perfectly designed to get the results it gets. The current economy prices a mother&rsquo;s care at zero, doesn&rsquo;t count an old-growth forest at all, and pays speculative investors handsomely. Lichen&rsquo;s economy is designed for a different result: every being&rsquo;s contribution counted — people, plants, animals, elements and places — woven into one web of reciprocity.</p>
      </div>
      <TwoMaps />
      <p class="maps-cap">Two maps of the same world. The distance between them is everything the current system gets wrong — and exactly what Lichen&rsquo;s algorithm works to close.</p>
      <div class="maps-cta">
        <a href="/about" class="btn btn-primary btn-up">Read the full story →</a>
        <p>The whole picture — the economy in action, the trust web, and the partnership of carbon and silicon intelligence — lives on the platform&rsquo;s About page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fsection sec-block">
    <div class="container sec-grid">
      <div class="sec-pic"><img class="phone-shot" src={img.begin} alt="" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div class="sec-copy">
        <h2 class="display sec-title">Where to begin?</h2>
        <p>While our <a href="/mission">mission</a> is big, our platform is strong and our business model is sound. We have the experience, discipline and strategic partnerships in place to start small and make an impact where it matters most.</p>
        <p>The platform is <a href="/about">live today</a> — and there&rsquo;s no better time to put down roots. <strong>Lichen grows by invitation</strong>: every member arrives through someone already here, woven into their web from day one. Know someone inside? Ask them for an invite. If not, introduce yourself at the door — we read every note and write back. Every new member receives <strong>three months of full Concierge membership, free</strong>, to explore the marketplace, courses, events, communities and care alongside us while the ecosystem takes shape. Or, if you feel called to carry the whole vision forward, become part of our <a href="/founders-circle">Founders Circle</a>.</p>
        <div class="begin-cta">
          <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary btn-up">Request an invitation</a>
          <a href="/founders-circle" class="btn btn-primary btn-up">Explore the Founders Circle</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fband">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to be part of the solution?</h2>
      <a href="/get-involved" class="btn btn-light btn-up">Get Involved</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .proj-eyebrow { color: var(--peach-light); }
  .intro-section { padding-bottom: var(--s-6); }
  .intro-lead { font-size: clamp(21px, 2.5vw, 27px); line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 300; max-width: 68ch; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .intro-section .btn { margin-top: 26px; }
  .intro-note { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(20px,2.4vw,26px); line-height: 1.3; color: var(--ink); margin-top: var(--s-7); max-width: 60ch; }
  .intro-rule { height: 1px; background: #12181C; border: 0; margin-top: var(--s-8); }
  .sec-block { padding-block: var(--s-8); }
  .sec-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center; }
  .sec-grid.flip .sec-pic { order: 2; }
  .sec-pic img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  /* Real platform screenshots, framed like the phone they live on. */
  .sec-pic .phone-shot {
    max-width: 320px; margin-inline: auto;
    border-radius: 19px; border: 4px solid #1a1a1a;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(18, 24, 28, 0.22);
  }
  .sec-title { font-size: clamp(24px,3vw,38px); margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .sec-copy p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 300; }
  .sec-copy a { color: var(--peach-deep); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .sec-copy a:hover { color: var(--rust); }
  /* Full container width, like every other section (founder 2026-07-26). */
  .maps-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 28px; }
  .maps-copy p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 300; max-width: 78ch; }
  .maps-cap { font-size: 14px; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink-muted); text-align: center; }
  .maps-cta { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .maps-cta p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: 60ch; text-align: center; }
  /* Side-by-side on desktop (compact type so both fit the column), with real
     beige air below before the green band (founder 2026-07-26). */
  .begin-cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-top: 24px; }
  .begin-cta .btn { margin-top: 0; color: #fff; font-size: 13px; padding: 11px 18px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .begin-cta .btn:hover { color: #fff; }
  .sec-block:last-of-type { padding-bottom: calc(var(--s-8) + 56px); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .sec-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .sec-grid.flip .sec-pic { order: 0; }
  }
</style>
